/**
@page about About ini_manager 1.1.0

ini_manager is a header-only C++26 value object for strict INI configuration.
See the main page for the dialect, checked API, resource limits, stream behavior
and file-replacement guarantees. Configuration values returned by the API own
their data.

The parser and native I/O helpers in ini::detail are implementation details,
not supported public extension interfaces.
*/
